 Channel\",\"subheading\":\"With Outrank we got real visibility inside AI Overviews and ChatGPT-style answers\",\"subheadingRich\":[{\"text\":\"With Outrank we got real visibility inside AI Overviews and ChatGPT-style answers\",\"isHighlighted\":false,\"isBold\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isUnderline\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"isCode\":false,\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"link\":\"$undefined\"}],\"category\":\"SaaS\",\"reviewerName\":\"Aidan Cramer\",\"reviewerPosition\":\"CEO / Cofounder\",\"reviewerImage\":\"https://cdn.outrank.so/outrank-success-stories-images/AIApply%20rp%20.png\",\"businessDescription\":\"AlApply finds high-match roles, tailors your resume \u0026 cover letter, auto-applies, and coaches you live - so you move from submit to scheduled fast.\",\"businessDescriptionRich\":[{\"text\":\"AlApply finds high-match roles, tailors your resume \u0026 cover letter, auto-applies, and coaches you live - so you move from submit to scheduled fast.\",\"isHighlighted\":false,\"isBold\":false,\"isItalic\":false,\"isUnderline\":false,\"isStrikethrough\":false,\"isCode\":false,\"color\":\"$undefined\",\"link\":\"$undefined\"}],\"mainPageScreenshot\":\"https://cdn.outrank.so/outrank-success-stories-images/AIApply%20wbss.png\",\"seoChallenges\":\"We’re a product-led site in a competitive space, and SEO kept getting deprioritized. We knew we needed consistent, high-quality content and stronger authority signals, but:\\n- We didn’t have time to research keywords, plan clusters, write, and publish on a schedule.\\n- Content was “when we can,” not systematic, so momentum never really built.\\n- Our domain authority wasn’t strong enough to break through, especially against bigger players.\\n- We also weren’t showing up much in the new AI-driven discovery surfaces (AI Overviews / ChatGPT-type answers)\",\"seoChallengesRich\":[{\"text\":\"We’re a product-led site in a competitive space, and SEO kept getting deprioritized. We knew we needed consistent, high-quality conte